
ENTITY {NAME}
COMPONENT Transform {XPOS} {YPOS} 0 12 10
COMPONENT Material PlayerMat
COMPONENT Renderer 2 2
COMPONENT Sprite CharacterAtlas PlayerWalk_Down00
COMPONENT Animation 
COMPONENT Drag 
COMPONENT State Idle
COMPONENT Script PlayerScript
ADDANIMATION Walk Up PlayerWalk_up
ADDANIMATION Walk Down PlayerWalk_down
ADDANIMATION Walk Right PlayerWalk_right
ADDANIMATION Walk Left PlayerWalk_left
ADDANIMATION Walk UpLeft PlayerWalk_upleft
ADDANIMATION Walk DownLeft PlayerWalk_downleft
ADDANIMATION Walk UpRight PlayerWalk_upright
ADDANIMATION Walk DownRight PlayerWalk_downright
STATEPRIORITY Walk 1 0 Ignore

ADDANIMATION Attack Down PlayerAttack_down
ADDANIMATION Attack Right PlayerAttack_right
ADDANIMATION Attack Up PlayerAttack_up
ADDANIMATION Attack Left PlayerAttack_left
ADDANIMATION Attack DownRight PlayerAttack_downright
ADDANIMATION Attack UpRight PlayerAttack_upright
ADDANIMATION Attack UpLeft PlayerAttack_upleft
ADDANIMATION Attack DownLeft PlayerAttack_downleft
STATEPRIORITY Attack 2 0.4 Restart

ADDANIMATION Idle Up PlayerIdle_up
ADDANIMATION Idle Down PlayerIdle_down
ADDANIMATION Idle Right PlayerIdle_right
ADDANIMATION Idle Left PlayerIdle_left
ADDANIMATION Idle UpLeft PlayerIdle_upleft
ADDANIMATION Idle DownLeft PlayerIdle_downleft
ADDANIMATION Idle UpRight PlayerIdle_upright
ADDANIMATION Idle DownRight PlayerIdle_downright
STATEPRIORITY Idle 0 0 Ignore

ADDANIMATION Hold None PlayerHold_down
STATEPRIORITY Hold 3 0 Ignore
ENTITYINIT {NAME}